...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

coordinator: 코디네이터 (HomeRenovationPlanner) { class: ours }
info_agent: 정보 안내 (InfoAgent) { class: ours }
rendering_editor: 렌더링 수정 (RenderingEditor) { class: ours }
edit_tool: 편집 도구 (edit_renovation_rendering) { class: ours }
list_tool: 목록 도구 (list_renovation_renderings) { class: ours }

flash: gemini-3-flash-preview { class: ext }

coordinator -> flash: instruction + transfer_to_agent 선언
info_agent -> flash: instruction
rendering_editor -> flash: instruction + 편집 도구 선언
rendering_editor -> edit_tool: 호출
rendering_editor -> list_tool: 호출
